 "summary_html": "<p>An <b>addendum</b> or <b>appendix</b>, in general, is an addition required to be made to a document by its author subsequent to its printing or publication. It comes from the gerundive <span><i lang=\"la\">addendum</i></span>, plural <span><i lang=\"la\">addenda</i></span>, \"that which is to be added\", from <span><i lang=\"la\">addere</i></span>.</p>",
